FAQ

  Q. "<Control>a" does not catch 'Control + Alt + a'. Is this a bug?
  A. No. uim does exact match. Following 2 definitions are
     distinguished.

   (define-key foo-key? "<Control>a")
   (define-key bar-key? "<Control><Alt>a")
